      {
        "code": "safety.copy.clearance_needed",
        "copyPath": "",
        "message": {
          "en": "Based on your answers, please check with a doctor or qualified exercise professional before starting or stepping up exercise. This doesn't mean you can't be active—most people can exercise safely once they've been checked. Come back after that and we'll set up a suitable plan.",
          "zh": "根据你的回答，开始（或加大）运动前，建议先咨询医生或合格的运动专业人员。这不代表你不能运动——大多数人在专业人士确认后都可以安全地动起来。确认后回到这里，我们会为你安排合适的计划。",
        },
        "ruleId": "safety.copy.clearance_needed",
        "severity": "stop",
